MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Every row of the receipt can be swiped sideways like a stack row: past
40 % of the width or flung it slides out (150 ms) and the notification is
dismissed by the user; the other rows close the gap. Ongoing rows only
follow the finger a little and spring back. Clear all is unchanged.
